      <p><seg source="#source-30191-30194">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30194-30206"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30206-30227">って、あたりを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30227-30292"><rb><seg source="#source-30227-30230">見</seg><g ref="#gaiji-4-2-12-11" source="#source-30230-30277">𢌞</g></rb><rt>みまわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30292-30298">した</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30298-30313"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30313-30316">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30316-30337"><rb>袖子</rb><rt>そでこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30337-30340">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30340-30355"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30355-30367">がなしに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30367-30382"><rb>悲</rb><rt>かな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30382-30388">しい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30388-30403"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30403-30409">いに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30409-30421"><rb>打</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30421-30439">たれた。その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30439-30454"><rb>悲</rb><rt>かな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30454-30463">しみは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30463-30481"><rb>幼</rb><rt>おさな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30481-30484">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30484-30496"><rb>日</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30496-30499">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30499-30514"><rb>別</rb><rt>わか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30514-30520">れを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30520-30532"><rb>告</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30532-30538">げて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30538-30550"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg sour